::Q001::[markdown]draw up (in battle):{
	~%-100%κεκώλῡκα#Incorrect. **κεκώλῡκα** is Principal Part 4 of **κωλύω** “hinder” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%λήψομαι#Incorrect. **λήψομαι** is Principal Part 2 of **λαμβάνω** “take” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%πράξω#Incorrect. **πράξω** is Principal Part 2 of **πράττω** “do” (Chapter 5).
	~%100%τάττω#Correct: **τάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **τάττω** “draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐπαιδεύθην#Incorrect. **ἐπαιδεύθην** is Principal Part 6 of **παιδεύω** “educate” (Chapter 2).
}


::Q002::[markdown]arrange, order:{
	~%100%ἐτάχθην#Correct: **ἐτάχθην** is Principal Part 6 of **τάττω** “arrange, order” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%κωλύσω#Incorrect. **κωλύσω** is Principal Part 2 of **κωλύω** “hinder” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%πάσχω#Incorrect. **πάσχω** is Principal Part 1 of **πάσχω** “suffer” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%ἠδίκησα#Incorrect. **ἠδίκησα** is Principal Part 3 of **ἀδικέω** “do wrong” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%ἐδίδαξα#Incorrect. **ἐδίδαξα** is Principal Part 3 of **διδάσκω** “teach” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q003::[markdown]δίκη, δίκης, ἡ:{
	~%-100%chance#Incorrect. **τύχη, τύχης, ἡ** means “chance” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%phalanx#Incorrect. **φάλαγξ, φάλαγγος, ἡ** means “phalanx” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%deed#Incorrect. **ἔργον, ἔργου, τό** means “deed” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%shrine#Incorrect. **ἱερόν, ἱεροῦ, τό** means “shrine” (Chapter 5).
	~%100%lawsuit#Correct: **δίκη, δίκης, ἡ** → “lawsuit” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q004::[markdown]μετά + gen.:{
	~%-100%from#Incorrect. **ἐκ + gen; ἐξ + gen** means “from” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%in order that#Incorrect. **ἵνα, ὡς, ὅπως** means “in order that” (Chapter 3).
	~%100%with#Correct: **μετά + gen.** → “with” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%under#Incorrect. **ὑπὸ + gen** means “under” (Chapter 5).
}


